      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just got the final word from the doctors today. career's over. torn ACL, meniscus, everything. they said i could maybe walk normal again but playing at a professional level is done\n\ni dont even know why im typing this. basketball has been literally everything since i was 9 years old. i wake up, i train, i play, that's who i am. or was i guess\n\nnow what. seriously. i have no idea who i am without this. no idea what im supposed to do with like 50 more years of just... existing i guess",
