    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah but what does that even mean though. \"still alive to feel it.\" feel what exactly? there's nothing on the other side of this. like i've tried to picture what my life looks like now and there's just nothing there. blank. \n\ni'd rather just not think about the future at all honestly. like genuinely what is there to look forward to. watching other people play? that's not a life. i don't see a point in any of it",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
