      "content": "It makes sense that you'd want to stop thinking about a future that feels like a blank page; the only honest thing left is to let go of the expectation that you need to fill the void with something new. You don't have to force yourself to imagine a life you can't see yet, because the most important part of this moment is simply surviving the numbness without judgment. If the only thing you can do right now is stop trying to find meaning, then that is enough for today.",
